т показан во всем приложении."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué icono se muestra para el contador O en toda la app."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies welk symbool overal in de app voor de O-teller wordt getoond."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz ikonę wyświetlaną dla licznika O w całej aplikacji."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez l'icône affichée pour le compteur O dans toute l'app."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvilket ikon som skal vises for O-telleren i hele appen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, welches Symbol in der ganzen App für den O-Zähler angezeigt wird."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli quale icona mostrare per il contatore O in tutta l'app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose which icon to display for the O Count throughout the app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"App全体でOカウントに表示するアイコンを選択します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha qual ícone exibir para a contagem O em todo o app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvilket ikon der vises for O-tælleren i hele appen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇在整個 App 中用於 O 計數的圖像。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilken symbol som visas för O-räknaren i hela appen."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde O Sayısı için gösterilecek simgeyi seç."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择在整个 App 中用于 O 计数的图标。"}}}},"hint_choose_which_rows_home_shows":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilka rader Hem visar – scener, stjärnor, studior, gallerier, kanaler – och i vilken ordning."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'nın hangi satırları göstereceğini 