ть на главной."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Favoris oubliés est désactivé. Activez-le dans Recommandations pour l'afficher sur l'accueil."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Forgotten Favorites is off. Turn it on in Recommendations to show it on Home."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vergeten favorieten staat uit. Schakel het in bij Aanbevelingen om het op Home te tonen."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Preferiti dimenticati è disattivato. Attivalo in Suggerimenti per mostrarlo nella Home."}}}},"hint_free_trial_is_for_new":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"免费试用仅适用于新订阅者。试用结束后，除非至少提前 24 小时取消，否则将按所示价格开始订阅。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den kostnadsfria provperioden gäller nya prenumeranter. När den slutar startar prenumerationen till det visade priset om den inte avslutas minst 24 timmar innan. "}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ücretsiz deneme yeni aboneler içindir. Deneme bittiğinde, en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse abonelik gösterilen fiyattan başlar. "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"免費試用僅適用於新訂閱者。試用結束後，除非你在至少 24 小時前取消，否則訂閱將以顯示的價格開始計費。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De gratis proefperiode is voor nieuwe abonnees. Daarna start het abonnement tegen de getoonde prijs, tenzij je het minstens 24 uur van tevoren opzegt. "}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die kostenlose Testphase gilt für neue Abonnenten. Danach beginnt das Abo zum angezeigten Preis, wenn du es nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vorher kündigst. "}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無料トライアルは新規登録者が対象です。終了後、24時間以上前に解約しない限り、表示価格でサブスクリプションが始まります。 "}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O teste gratuito é para novos assinantes. Quando ele terminar, a assinatura começa pelo preço exibido, a menos que seja cancelada pelo menos 24 horas antes. "}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den gratis prøveperiode er for nye abonnenter. Når den slutter, starter abonnementet til den viste pris, medmindre det opsiges mindst 24 timer før. "}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Бесплатный пробный период — для новых подписчиков. По его окончании подписка начнется по указанной цене, если не отменить ее как минимум за 24 часа. "}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'essai gratuit est réservé aux nouveaux abonnés. À sa fin, l'abonnement démarre au prix indiqué, sauf résiliation au moins 24 heures avant. "}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The free trial is for new subscribers. When it ends, the subscription starts at the price shown unless canceled at least 24 hours before. "}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bezpłatny okres próbny jest dla nowych subskrybentów. Po jego zakończeniu subskrypcja zaczyna się w podanej cenie, chyba że zostanie anulowana co najmniej 24 godziny wcześniej. "}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gratis prøveperiode gjelder for nye abonnenter. Når den slutter, starter abonnementet til prisen som vises, med mindre det avsluttes minst 24 timer før. "}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La prova gratuita è per i nuovi abbonati. Al termine, l'abbonamento inizia al prezzo indicato, a meno che non venga annullato almeno 24 ore prima. "}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"무료 체험은 신규 구독자를 위한 것입니다. 체험이 끝나면 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않는 한 표시된 가격으로 구독이 시작됩니다. "}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La prueba gratuita es para suscriptores nuevos. Al terminar, la suscripción empieza al precio indicado, salvo que se cancele al menos 24 horas antes. "}}}},"hint_free_trial_is_for_new_subscribers":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Бесплатный пробный период — для новых подписчиков. По его окончании подписка начнется по указанной цене, если не отменить ее заранее. "}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bezpłatny okres próbny jest dla nowych subskrybentów. Po jego zakończeniu subskrypcja zaczyna się w podanej cenie, chyba że zostanie wcześniej anulowana. "}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La prova gratuita è per i nuovi abbonati. Al termine, l'abbonamento inizia al prezzo indicato, a meno che non venga annullato prima. "}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"무료 체험은 신규 구독자를 위한 것입니다. 체험이 끝나면 미리 취소하지 않는 한 표시된 가격으로 구독이 시작됩니다. "}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De gratis proefperiode is voor nieuwe abonnees. Daarna start het abonnement tegen de getoonde prijs, tenzij je het van tevoren opzegt. "}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The free trial is for new subscribers. When it ends, the subscription starts at the price shown unless canceled before. "}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O teste gratuito é para novos assinantes. Quando ele terminar, a assinatura começa pelo preço exibido, a menos que seja cancelada antes. "}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'essai gratuit est réservé aux nouveaux abonnés. À sa fin, l'abonnement démarre au prix indiqué, sauf résiliation avant. "}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die kostenlose Testphase gilt für neue Abonnenten. Danach beginnt das Abo zum angezeigten Preis, wenn du es nicht vorher kündigst. "}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無料トライアルは新規登録者が対象です。終了後、事前に解約しない限り、表示価格でサブスクリプションが始まります。 "}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gratis prøveperiode gjelder for nye abonnenter. Når den slutter, starter abonnementet til prisen som vises, med mindre det avsluttes før. "}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La prueba gratuita es para suscriptores nuevos. Al terminar, la suscripción empieza al precio indicado, salvo que se cancele antes. "}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den gratis prøveperiode er for nye abonnenter. Når den slutter, starter abonnementet til den viste pris, medmindre det opsiges inden. "}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"免费试用仅适用于新订阅者。试用结束后，除非提前取消，否则将按所示价格开始订阅。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"免費試用僅適用於新訂閱者。試用結束後，除非你事先取消，否則訂閱將以顯示的價格開始計費。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ücretsiz deneme yeni aboneler içindir. Deneme bittiğinde, önceden iptal edilmezse abonelik gösterilen fiyattan başlar. "}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den kostnadsfria provperioden gäller nya prenumeranter. När den slutar startar prenumerationen till det visade priset om den inte avslutas innan dess. "}}}},"hint_full_screen_one_after_another":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全螢幕，逐一播放。▲ ▼ 瀏覽，◀ ▶ 搜尋，按下以查看資訊和模式。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全屏，依次播放。▲ ▼ 浏览，◀ ▶ 跳转，按下查看信息和模式。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tam ekran, art arda. ▲ ▼ gezin, ◀ ▶ sar, bilgi ve modlar için tıkla."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Helskärm, en i taget. ▲ ▼ bläddra, ◀ ▶ spola, klicka för info och lägen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全画面で1つずつ表示。▲ ▼ で切り替え、◀ ▶ でシーク、クリックで情報とモード。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vollbild, eins nach dem anderen. ▲ ▼ blättern, ◀ ▶ spulen, Klick für Infos und Modi."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Full-screen, one after another. ▲ ▼ browse, ◀ ▶ seek, click for info and modes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Во весь экран, одна за другой. ▲ ▼ — просмотр, ◀ ▶ — перемотка, нажатие — сведения и режимы."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Em tela cheia, um após o outro. ▲ ▼ navegar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clique para informações e modos."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"En plein écran, l'un après l'autre. ▲ ▼ parcourir, ◀ ▶ avancer/reculer, clic pour les infos et les modes."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"전체 화면으로 하나씩 표시합니다. ▲ ▼ 탐색, ◀ ▶ 탐색 이동, 클릭하여 정보 및 모드 보기."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Na pełnym ekranie, jedna po drugiej. ▲ ▼ przeglądaj, ◀ ▶ przewijaj, kliknij, aby zobaczyć informacje i tryby."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A pantalla completa, uno tras otro. ▲ ▼ explorar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clic para info y modos."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fullskjerm, én etter én. ▲ ▼ bla, ◀ ▶ spol, klikk for info og moduser."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schermvullend, de een na de ander. ▲ ▼ blader, ◀ ▶ zoek, klik voor info en modi."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fuld skærm, én efter én. ▲ ▼ gennemse, ◀ ▶ spol, klik for info og tilstande."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A schermo intero, uno dopo l'altro. ▲ ▼ sfoglia, ◀ ▶ cerca, clic per info e modalità."}}}},"hint_generate_heatmaps_and_speeds_for":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Genera heatmap e velocità per le scene interattive"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Genereer heatmaps en snelheden voor interactieve scènes"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"インタラクティブシーンのヒートマップと速度を生成"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gerar mapas de calor e velocidades para cenas interativas"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generer heatmaps og hastigheder til interaktive scener"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generuj mapy cieplne i prędkości dla scen interaktywnych"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Generate heatmaps and speeds for interactive scenes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Heatmaps und Geschwindigkeiten für interaktive Szenen generieren"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"