Sopra 1× porta anche nuove scene."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser det aldrig. Over 1× giver også nye scener."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「非表示」にすると表示されません。1×より上にすると新しいシーンも表示されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"가려짐으로 설정하면 표시되지 않습니다. 1×보다 높으면 새로운 영상도 가져옵니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gizli, onu hiç göstermez. 1× üzeri yeni sahneler de getirir."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dold visar det aldrig. Över 1× ger också nya scener."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“隐藏”表示永不显示。高于 1× 还会带来新的短片。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「已隱藏」表示永不顯示。高於 1× 時也會帶來新短片。"}}}},"hint_hidden_never_shows_it_above_1":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dold visar det aldrig. Över 1× ger också nya scener. Svep för att ta bort."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「已隱藏」表示永不顯示。高於 1× 時也會帶來新短片。滑動即可移除。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gizli, onu hiç göstermez. 1× üzeri yeni sahneler de getirir. Kaldırmak için kaydır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“隐藏”表示永不显示。高于 1× 还会带来新的短片。轻扫以移除。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「非表示」にすると表示されません。1×より上にすると新しいシーンも表示されます。スワイプで削除。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hidden never shows it. Above 1× also brings new scenes. Swipe to remove."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser det aldrig. Over 1× giver også nye scener. Stryg for at fjerne."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nascosto non lo mostra mai. Sopra 1× porta anche nuove scene. Scorri per rimuovere."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"가려짐으로 설정하면 표시되지 않습니다. 1×보다 높으면 새로운 영상도 가져옵니다. 쓸어넘겨 제거하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masqué ne l'affiche jamais. Au-delà de 1×, de nouvelles scènes sont aussi proposées. Balayez pour retirer."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryte nigdy się nie pojawia. Powyżej 1× przynosi też nowe sceny. Przesuń, aby usunąć."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verborgen toont het nooit. Boven 1× komen er ook nieuwe scènes. Veeg om te verwijderen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены. Смахните, чтобы удалить."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgeblendet zeigt es nie. Über 1× bringt auch neue Szenen. Zum Entfernen wischen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto nunca o mostra. Acima de 1× também traz novas cenas. Deslize para remover."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto no lo muestra nunca. Por encima de 1× también trae escenas nuevas. Desliza para quitar."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser den aldri. Over 1× gir også nye scener. Sveip for å fjerne."}}}},"hint_hide_sections_you_do_not":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hide sections you do not use. They disappear from the sidebar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Скройте неиспользуемые разделы. Они исчезнут с боковой панели."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculte as seções que você não usa. Elas desaparecem da barra lateral."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Blende Bereiche aus, die du nicht nutzt. Sie verschwinden aus der Seitenleiste."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"사용하지 않는 섹션을 가립니다. 사이드바에서 사라집니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masquez les sections inutilisées. Elles disparaissent de la barre latérale."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjul deler du ikke bruker. De forsvinner fra sidepanelet."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使わないセクションを非表示にします。サイドバーから消えます。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryj nieużywane sekcje. Znikną z paska bocznego."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verberg onderdelen die je niet gebruikt. Ze verdwijnen uit de navigatiekolom."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculta las secciones que no uses. Desaparecen de la barra lateral."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjul sektioner, du ikke bruger. De forsvinder fra sidepanelet."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nascondi le sezioni che non usi. Scompaiono dalla barra laterale."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"隱藏你不使用的區段。它們會從側邊欄消失。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"隐藏你不使用的版块。它们会从边栏中消失。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dölj sektioner du inte använder. De försvinner från sidofältet."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kullanmadığın bölümleri gizle. Kenar çubuğundan kaybolurlar."}}}},"hint_host_answered_but_not_as":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機有回應，但不是 Stash。請檢查位址、子路徑和自訂標頭。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade, men inte som Stash. Kontrollera adress, undersökväg och anpassade headers."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主机有响应，但不是 Stash。请检查地址、子路径和自定义标头。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana bilgisayar yanıt verdi, ancak Stash olarak değil. Adresi, alt yolu ve özel başlıkları denetle."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte, men ikke som Stash. Sjekk adressen, understien og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El host respondió, pero no como Stash. Comprueba la dirección, la subruta y los encabezados personalizados."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Værten svarede, men ikke som Stash. Tjek adressen, understien og de brugerdefinerede headers."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホストは応答しましたが、Stashではありません。アドレス、サブパス、カスタムヘッダーを確認してください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat geantwortet, aber nicht als Stash. Prüfe Adresse, Unterpfad und eigene Header."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'host ha risposto, ma non come Stash. Controlla indirizzo, sottopercorso e header personalizzati."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"호스트가 응답했지만 Stash가 아닙니다. 주소, 하위 경로 및 사용자 지정 헤더를 확인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'hôte a répondu, mais pas en tant que Stash. Vérifiez l'adresse, le sous-chemin et les en-têtes personnalisés."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The host answered, but not as Stash. Check the address, subpath and custom headers."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O host respondeu, mas não como Stash. Verifique o endereço, o subcaminho e os cabeçalhos personalizados."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Хост ответил, но не как Stash. Проверьте адрес, подпуть и собственные заголовки."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De host antwoordde, maar niet als Stash. Controleer het adres, het subpad en de aangepaste headers."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Host odpowiedział, ale nie jako Stash. Sprawdź adres, ścieżkę podrzędną i własne nagłówki."}}}},"hint_host_answered_with_web_page":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'hôte a répondu avec une page web, pas Stash — probablement une page de connexion ou de proxy. Vérifiez l'adresse et les en-têtes personnalisés."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The host answered with a web page, not Stash — likely a login or proxy page. Check the address and custom headers."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O host respondeu com uma página web, não com o Stash — provavelmente uma página de login ou de proxy. Verifique o endereço e os cabeçalhos personalizados."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホストがStashではなくWebページで応答しました。ログインページまたはプロキシページの可能性があります。アドレスとカスタムヘッダーを確認してください。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De host antwoordde met een webpagina, niet met Stash – waarschijnlijk een inlog- of proxypagina. Controleer het adres en de aangepaste headers."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El host respondió con una página web, no con Stash; probablemente una página de inicio de sesión o de proxy. Comprueba la dirección y los encabezados personalizados."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Host odpowiedział stroną internetową, a nie jako Stash — prawdopodobnie stroną logowania lub proxy. Sprawdź adres i własne nagłówki."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade med en webbsida, inte Stash – troligen en inloggnings- eller proxysida. Kontrollera adressen och anpassade headers."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat mit einer Webseite geantwortet, nicht als Stash – vermutlich eine Login- oder Proxy-Seite. Prüfe Adresse und eigene Header."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Хост ответил веб-страницей, а не Stash — вероятно, страницей входа или прокси. Проверьте адрес и собственные заголовки."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte med en nettside, ikke Stash – sannsynligvis en innloggings- eller proxyside. Sjekk adressen og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Værten svarede med en webside, ikke Stash – sandsynligvis en login- eller proxyside. Tjek adressen og de brugerdefinerede headers."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"호스트가 Stash가 아닌 웹 페이지로 응답했습니다. 로그인 또는 프록시 페이지일 수 있습니다. 주소와 사용자 지정 헤더를 확인하세요."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'host ha risposto con una pagina web, non Stash: probabilmente una pagina di login o di un proxy. Controlla l'indirizzo e gli header personalizzati."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主机返回的是网页而不是 Stash — 可能是登录页或代理页。请检查地址和自定义标头。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機回應的是網頁而非 Stash — 可能是登入或代理伺服器頁面。請檢查位址和自訂標頭。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana bilgisayar Stash yerine bir web sayfasıyla yanıt verdi — büyük olasılıkla bir giriş veya proxy sayfası. Adresi ve özel başlıkları denetle."}}}},"hint_how_long_scene_has_to":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bir sahnenin oynatılmış sayılması ve konumunun kaydedilmesi için ne kadar oynaması gerektiği."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片須播放多久才會計為已播放並儲存播放位置。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片需要播放多长时间才会计为已播放并存储其播放位置。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur länge en scen måste spelas innan den räknas som spelad och positionen sparas."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor lenge en scene må spilles før den telles som avspilt og posisjonen lagres."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"영상이 재생한 것으로 계산되고 위치가 저장되기까지 재생해야 하는 시간입니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Por quanto tempo uma cena precisa ser reproduzida antes de contar como reproduzida e ter sua posição salva."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How long a scene has to play before it counts as played and its position is saved."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Durée de lecture d'une scène avant qu'elle compte comme lue et que sa position soit enregistrée."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak długo scena musi być odtwarzana, aby została uznana za odtworzoną i zapisano jej pozycję."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie lange eine Szene laufen muss, bevor sie als gespielt zählt und ihre Position gespeichert wird."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンが再生済みとみなされ、位置が保存されるまでに必要な再生時間です。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoe lang een scène moet spelen voordat hij als afgespeeld telt en de positie wordt bewaard."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor længe en scene skal afspilles, før den tæller som afspillet, og positionen gemmes."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto deve durare la riproduzione di una scena prima che conti come riprodotta e la posizione venga salvata."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сколько должна воспроизводиться сцена, чтобы считаться просмотренной и чтобы ее позиция сохранилась."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto tiempo debe reproducirse una escena para contar como reproducida y guardar su posición."}}}},"hint_how_much_each_part_steers":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Насколько каждый фактор влияет на выбор."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo każdy element wpływa na wybór."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各要素が選択にどの程度影響するかを設定します。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dans quelle mesure chaque élément influence la sélection."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto influye cada parte en la selección."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto cada parte influencia as escolhas."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"각 요소가 선택에 미치는 영향의 정도입니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye hver del styrer utvalget."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket varje del styr urvalet."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoeveel elk onderdeel de keuzes bepaalt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto ogni parte influisce sulla scelta."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor meget hver del påvirker valgene."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie stark jeder Teil die Auswahl beeinflusst."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How much each part steers the picks."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每个部分对推荐结果的影响程度。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Her bölümün seçimleri ne kadar yönlendirdiği."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各項目對推薦結果的影響程度。"}}}},"hint_how_much_of_content_shows":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"内容透过按钮、胶囊和栏的程度。适用于所有玻璃效果界面。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İçeriğin düğmelerden, haplardan ve çubuklardan ne kadar göründüğü. Tüm cam arayüz öğelerine uygulanır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket av innehållet som syns genom knappar, etiketter och fält. Gäller allt glas i gränssnittet."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"按鈕、膠囊和列透出內容的程度。套用於所有玻璃介面元素。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoeveel van de inhoud doorschijnt door knoppen, pillen en balken. Geldt voor alle glazen elementen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo zawartość prześwituje przez przyciski, etykiety i paski. Dotyczy wszystkich elementów ze szkła."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto del contenuto traspare attraverso pulsanti, pillole e barre. Vale per tutti gli elementi in vetro."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ボタン、ピル、バーからコンテンツがどの程度透けて見えるかを設定します。すべてのガラス要素に適用されます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie viel vom Inhalt durch Buttons, Pillen und Leisten scheint. Gilt für alle Glas-Elemente."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How much of the content shows through buttons, pills and bars. Applies to all glass chrome."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto contenido se ve a través de botones, píldoras y barras. Se aplica a todos los elementos de cristal."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Насколько контент просвечивает сквозь кнопки, плашки и панели. Применяется ко всем стеклянным элементам."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"버튼, 알약 모양 버튼 및 막대를 통해 콘텐츠가 비치는 정도입니다. 모든 유리 요소에 적용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quantité de contenu visible à travers les boutons, pastilles et barres. S'applique à tous les éléments en verre."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto do conteúdo aparece através de botões, pílulas e barras. Vale para todo o visual de vidro."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor meget af indholdet der skinner igennem knapper, piller og bjælker. Gælder for alle glaselementer."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye av innholdet som synes gjennom knapper, piller og linjer. Gjelder all glass-chrome."}}}},"hint_how_much_of_content_shows_through":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye av innholdet som synes gjennom glassknappene, pillene og linjene over videoer og bilder."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto del contenuto traspare attraverso i pulsanti, le pillole e le barre in vetro sopra video e immagini."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket av innehållet som syns genom glasknappar, etiketter och fält som ritas över videor och bilder."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quantité de contenu visible à travers les boutons, pastilles et barres en verre affichés sur les vidéos et images."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"動画や画像の上に表示されるガラスのボタン、ピル、バーからコンテンツがどの程度透けて見えるかを設定します。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto contenido se ve a través de los botones, píldoras y barras de cristal sobre videos e imágenes."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"비디오와 이미지 위에 그려지는 유리 버튼, 알약 모양 버튼 및 막대를 통해 콘텐츠가 비치는 정도입니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How much of the content shows through the glass buttons, pills and bars drawn over videos and images."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoeveel van de inhoud doorschijnt door de glazen knoppen, pillen en balken boven video's en afbeeldingen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie viel vom Inhalt durch die Glas-Buttons, Pillen und Leisten über Videos und Bildern scheint."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo zawartość prześwituje przez szklane przyciski, etykiety i paski nad wideo i obrazami."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Насколько контент просвечивает сквозь стеклянные кнопки, плашки и панели поверх видео и изображений."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto do conteúdo aparece através dos botões, pílulas e barras de vidro desenhados sobre vídeos e imagens."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor meget af indholdet der skinner igennem glasknapperne, -pillerne og -bjælkerne over videoer og billeder."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İçeriğin, videoların ve resimlerin üzerine çizilen cam düğmelerden, haplardan ve çubuklardan ne kadar göründüğü."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"繪製在影片和圖片上方的玻璃按鈕、膠囊和列透出內容的程度。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"内容透过覆盖在视频和图片上的玻璃按钮、胶囊和栏的程度。"}}}},"hint_icloud_storage_for_settings_is":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"用于设置的 iCloud 储存空间已满。部分设置未同步。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloud 的設定儲存空間已滿。部分設定未同步。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ayarlar için iCloud depolama alanı dolu. Bazı ayarlar eşzamanlanmıyor."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloud-lagringen för inställningar är full. Vissa inställningar synkas inte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O armazenamento do iCloud para ajustes está cheio. Alguns ajustes não são sincronizados."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"設定用のiCloudストレージがいっぱいです。一部の設定は同期されません。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pamięć iCloud na ustawienia jest pełna. Niektóre ustawienia nie są synchronizowane."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le stockage iCloud des réglages est plein. Certains réglages ne sont pas synchronisés."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"설정용 iCloud 저장 공간이 가득 찼습니다. 일부 설정이 동기화되지 않습니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lo spazio iCloud per le impostazioni è pieno. Alcune impostazioni non vengono sincronizzate."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El almacenamiento de iCloud para ajustes está lleno. Algunos ajustes no se sincronizan."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iCloud storage for settings is full. Some settings are not synced."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloud-opslag voor instellingen is vol. Sommige instellingen worden niet gesynchroniseerd."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der iCloud-Speicher für Einstellungen ist voll. Einige Einstellungen werden nicht synchronisiert."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloud-lagringen for innstillinger er full. Noen innstillinger synkroniseres ikke."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Хранилище iCloud для настроек заполнено. Некоторые настройки не синхронизированы."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloud-lageret til indstillinger er fuldt. Nogle indstillinger synkroniseres ikke."}}}},"hint_identify_started_for_arg_scenes":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Identificación iniciada para %@ escenas con: %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"s