"needs_review","value":"Открывает эту сцену; «Назад» возвращает в RateMe"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 영상을 엽니다. 뒤로를 누르면 RateMe로 돌아갑니다"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abre esta escena; Atrás vuelve a RateMe"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opens this scene; Back returns to RateMe"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apre questa scena; Indietro torna a RateMe"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Åbner denne scene; Tilbage vender tilbage til RateMe"}}}},"hint_optional_used_instead_of_address":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcional. Usado no lugar do endereço acima sempre que responder, por exemplo na sua rede doméstica. Volta automaticamente ao outro."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcjonalnie. Używany zamiast powyższego adresu, gdy tylko odpowiada, np. w sieci domowej. W razie potrzeby automatycznie wraca do zwykłego adresu."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"선택 사항. 홈 네트워크 등에서 응답할 때마다 위의 주소 대신 사용됩니다. 응답하지 않으면 자동으로 되돌아갑니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Optional. Used instead of the address above whenever it answers, for example on your home network. Falls back automatically."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facoltativo. Usato al posto dell'indirizzo qui sopra ogni volta che risponde, ad esempio sulla rete di casa. Altrimenti torna automaticamente all'altro."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfritt. Brukes i stedet for adressen ovenfor når den svarer, for eksempel på hjemmenettverket. Faller automatisk tilbake."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optioneel. Wordt gebruikt in plaats van het adres hierboven zodra het antwoordt, bijvoorbeeld op je thuisnetwerk. Valt automatisch terug."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcional. Se usa en lugar de la dirección de arriba siempre que responda, por ejemplo en tu red doméstica. Si no, se vuelve a la otra automáticamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optional. Wird statt der Adresse oben verwendet, sobald sie antwortet, etwa in deinem Heimnetz. Wechselt automatisch zurück."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Необязательно. Используется вместо адреса выше, когда отвечает, например в домашней сети. При недоступности — автоматический возврат."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfri. Bruges i stedet for adressen ovenfor, når den svarer, f.eks. på dit hjemmenetværk. Skifter automatisk tilbage."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"任意。応答がある場合（自宅のネットワークなど）は、上のアドレスの代わりに使用されます。自動的に切り替わります。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facultatif. Utilisée à la place de l'adresse ci-dessus dès qu'elle répond, par exemple sur votre réseau domestique. Bascule automatiquement sinon."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選填。只要能連上，就會取代上方的位址，例如在你的家用網路中。連不上時會自動改用原位址。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İsteğe bağlı. Yanıt verdiği sürece, örneğin ev ağında, yukarıdaki adres yerine kullanılır. Otomatik olarak geri döner."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valfritt. Används i stället för adressen ovan när den svarar, till exempel på ditt hemnätverk. Faller tillbaka automatiskt."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"可选。只要该地址有响应（例如在家庭网络中），就会代替上方地址使用。会自动回退。"}}}},"hint_original_could_not_be_played":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法播放原始文件 — 正在使用服务器转码"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法播放原始檔 — 改用伺服器轉檔"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Orijinal oynatılamadı — sunucu dönüştürmesi kullanılıyor"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke afspilles – bruger serverens omkodning"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke spilles av – bruker serverens transkoding"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original konnte nicht abgespielt werden – Server-Transcode wird verwendet"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo reproducir el original; se usa la transcodificación del servidor"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Origineel kon niet worden afgespeeld – de servertranscode wordt gebruikt"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original could not be played — using the server transcode"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"オリジナルを再生できませんでした — サーバーのトランスコードを使用します"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie można odtworzyć oryginału — używane jest transkodowanie serwera"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalet kunde inte spelas – använder serverns omkodning"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível reproduzir o original — usando a transcodificação do servidor"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile riprodurre l'originale: uso della transcodifica del server"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось воспроизвести оригинал — используется перекодировка сервера"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'original n'a pas pu être lu — utilisation du transcodage du serveur"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"원본을 재생할 수 없습니다 — 서버 트랜스코드를 사용합니다"}}}},"hint_other_names_for_this_tag":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navne for dette tag. Stryg til venstre for at fjerne et."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 태그의 다른 이름입니다. 제거하려면 왼쪽으로 쓸어넘기세요."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このタグの別名です。左にスワイプして削除します。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navn på denne taggen. Sveip til venstre for å fjerne ett."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altri nomi per questo tag. Scorri a sinistra per rimuoverne uno."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere namen voor dit label. Veeg naar links om er een te verwijderen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere Namen für diesen Tag. Nach links wischen, um einen zu entfernen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Другие названия этого тега. Смахните влево, чтобы удалить."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inne nazwy tego tagu. Przesuń w lewo, aby usunąć."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otros nombres de esta etiqueta. Desliza a la izquierda para quitar uno."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Outros nomes para esta etiqueta. Deslize para a esquerda para remover um."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Other names for this tag. Swipe left to remove one."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Autres noms de cette étiquette. Balayez vers la gauche pour en retirer un."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu etiketin diğer adları. Birini kaldırmak için sola kaydır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此標籤的其他名稱。向左滑動即可移除。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andra namn på taggen. Svep åt vänster för att ta bort ett."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此标签的其他名称。向左轻扫可移除。"}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Apple 账户扣除。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 App Store 设置中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Apple Kimliğin'den alınır. Abonelikler, dönem bitmeden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. App Store ayarlarından istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Apple ID 扣款。除非在期間結束前至少 24 小時取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 App Store 設定中管理或取消。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Apple-ID. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas minst 24 timmar innan perioden slutar. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i dina App Store-inställningar."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Apple-ID-en din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes minst 24 timer før perioden slutter. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i App Store-innstillingene."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Apple ID. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze minstens 24 uur voor het einde van de periode opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in je App Store-instellingen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado no seu Apple ID. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser nos ajustes da App Store."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på dit Apple-id. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges mindst 24 timer før periodens udløb. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i dine App Store-indstillinger."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über deine Apple-ID abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf des Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit in deinen App-Store-Einstellungen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего Apple ID. Подписка продлевается автоматически, если не отменить ее как минимум за 24 часа до конца периода. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в настройках App Store."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはApple IDに請求されます。サブスクリプションは期間終了の24時間以上前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。App Storeの設定でいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego Apple ID. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane co najmniej 24 godziny przed końcem okresu. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach App Store."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre identifiant Apple. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans les réglages de l'App Store."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo ID Apple. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nelle impostazioni dell'App Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Payment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store settings."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu Apple ID. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes de que termine el periodo. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en los ajustes del App Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Apple ID로 청구됩니다. 구독 기간이 끝나기 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 App Store 설정에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your_google":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo account Google Play. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nel Play Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Google Play 계정으로 청구됩니다. 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 Play 스토어에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado na sua conta do Google Play. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser na Play Store."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Google Play-account. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in de Play Store."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Google Play-konto. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i Play Butik."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på din Google Play-konto. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i Play Butik."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはGoogle Playアカウントに請求されます。サブスクリプションは解約しない限り自動更新されます。Playストアでいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего аккаунта Google Play. Подписка продлевается автоматически, пока ее не отменят. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в Play Store."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über dein Google-Play-Konto abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit im Play Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Payment is charged to your Google Play account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled. Manage or cancel anytime in the Play Store."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Google Play-kontoen din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i Play Store."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego konta Google Play. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w Sklepie Play."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre compte Google Play. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans le Play Store."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu cuenta de Google Play. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en Play Store."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Google Play 帐户扣除。除非取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Google Play 帳戶扣款。除非取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Google Play hesabından alınır. Abonelikler iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. Play Store'da istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}}}},"hint_pick_accent_color_used_for":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pick the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}}}},"hint_pick_app_theme_and_accent":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el tema de la app y el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリのテーマと、アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pick the app theme and the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha o tema do app e a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il tema dell'app e il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"da":{"stringUni