t":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 在未設定帳號密碼時會拒絕公用 IP。請在 Stash 中設定使用者名稱和密碼，或以 public_whitelist 允許此 IP。"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rifiuta gli IP pubblici finché non ha credenziali. Imposta nome utente e password in Stash o consenti questo IP con public_whitelist."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash refuse les IP publiques tant qu'aucun identifiant n'est défini. Définissez un nom d'utilisateur et un mot de passe dans Stash, ou autorisez cette IP avec public_whitelist."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashは認証情報が設定されていない間、パブリックIPからの接続を拒否します。Stashでユーザー名とパスワードを設定するか、public_whitelistでこのIPを許可してください。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avviser offentlige IP-adresser så lenge det ikke har påloggingsdetaljer. Angi brukernavn og passord i Stash, eller tillat denne IP-adressen med public_whitelist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rechaza las IP públicas mientras no tenga credenciales. Define un usuario y una contraseña en Stash o permite esta IP con public_whitelist."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash afviser offentlige IP-adresser, så længe der ikke er loginoplysninger. Angiv et brugernavn og en adgangskode i Stash, eller tillad denne IP med public_whitelist."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avvisar publika IP-adresser så länge inga inloggningsuppgifter finns. Ange ett användarnamn och lösenord i Stash eller tillåt IP-adressen med public_whitelist."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash odrzuca publiczne adresy IP, dopóki nie ma danych logowania. Ustaw nazwę użytkownika i hasło w Stash lub zezwól na ten adres IP przez public_whitelist."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash는 자격 증명이 없는 동안 공인 IP를 거부합니다. Stash에서 사용자 이름과 암호를 설정하거나 public_whitelist로 이 IP를 허용하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash weigert openbare IP-adressen zolang er geen inloggegevens zijn. Stel een gebruikersnaam en wachtwoord in Stash in, of sta dit IP-adres toe met public_whitelist."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O Stash recusa IPs públicos enquanto não tiver credenciais. Defina um usuário e senha no Stash ou permita este IP com public_whitelist."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stash refuses public IPs while it has no credentials. Set a username and password in Stash, or allow this IP with public_whitelist."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash отклоняет публичные IP, пока у него нет учетных данных. Задайте имя пользователя и пароль в Stash или разрешите этот IP через public_whitelist."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash lehnt öffentliche IPs ab, solange keine Zugangsdaten gesetzt sind. Lege in Stash Benutzername und Passwort fest oder erlaube diese IP mit public_whitelist."}}}},"hint_stash_rejected_reverse_proxy_in":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avviste den omvendte proxyen foran den. Legg til proxyens IP i trusted_proxies i Stash-konfigurasjonen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash heeft de reverse proxy ervoor geweigerd. Voeg het IP-adres van de proxy toe aan trusted_proxies in de configuratie van Stash."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O Stash rejeitou o proxy reverso à sua frente. Adicione o IP do proxy a trusted_proxies na configuração do Stash."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash afviste den reverse proxy, der står foran. Føj proxyens IP til trusted_proxies i Stashs konfiguration."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashが前段のリバースプロキシを拒否しました。Stashの設定でプロキシのIPをtrusted_proxiesに追加してください。"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash ha rifiutato il reverse proxy davanti a sé. Aggiungi l'IP del proxy a trusted_proxies nella configurazione di Stash."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stash rejected the reverse proxy in front of it. Add the proxy's IP to trusted_proxies in Stash's config."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rechazó el proxy inverso que tiene delante. Añade la IP del proxy a trusted_proxies en la configuración de Stash."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash a rejeté le proxy inverse placé devant lui. Ajoutez l'IP du proxy à trusted_proxies dans la configuration de Stash."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash odrzucił reverse proxy działające przed nim. Dodaj IP proxy do trusted_proxies w konfiguracji Stash."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash가 앞단의 리버스 프록시를 거부했습니다. Stash 구성의 trusted_proxies에 프록시 IP를 추가하세요."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash hat den vorgeschalteten Reverse-Proxy abgelehnt. Trage die IP des Proxys unter trusted_proxies in der Stash-Konfiguration ein."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash отклонил обратный прокси перед ним. Добавьте IP прокси в trusted_proxies в конфигурации Stash."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash önündeki ters proxy'yi reddetti. Proxy'nin IP'sini Stash yapılandırmasındaki trusted_proxies'e ekle."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avvisade den omvända proxyn framför den. Lägg till proxyns IP i trusted_proxies i Stashs konfiguration."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 拒絕了位於其前方的反向代理伺服器。請將代理伺服器的 IP 加入 Stash 設定中的 trusted_proxies。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 拒绝了其前面的反向代理。请将代理的 IP 添加到 Stash 配置中的 trusted_proxies。"}}}},"hint_stashy_arg_is_latest_version":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ 是最新版本。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ 是最新版本。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ en son sürüm."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@은(는) 최신 버전입니다."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ er den nyeste version."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ is de nieuwste versie."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"stashy %@ is the latest version."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ は最新バージョンです。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ är den senaste versionen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy %@ é a versão mais recente."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ è la versione più recente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ ist die neueste Version."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ — последняя версия."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ est la dernière version."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ er den nyeste versjonen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ to najnowsza wersja."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ es la versión más reciente."}}}},"hint_stashy_connects_to_intiface_desktop":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy подключается к Intiface Desktop или Intiface Central через WebSockets. Убедитесь, что в настройках Intiface включен параметр «Enable Remote Network Access»."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy kobler til Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Sørg for at «Enable Remote Network Access» er slått på i Intiface-innstillingene."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy verbindet sich per WebSockets mit Intiface Desktop oder Intiface Central. Stelle sicher, dass „Enable Remote Network Access“ in den Intiface-Einstellungen aktiv ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy se conecta a Intiface Desktop o Intiface Central mediante WebSockets. Asegúrate de que «Enable Remote Network Access» esté activado en los ajustes de Intiface."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy łączy się z Intiface Desktop lub Intiface Central przez WebSockets. Upewnij się, że w ustawieniach Intiface włączono „Enable Remote Network Access”."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy se conecta ao Intiface Desktop ou Intiface Central via WebSockets. Verifique se 'Enable Remote Network Access' está ativado nos ajustes do Intiface."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy는 WebSocket을 통해 Intiface Desktop 또는 Intiface Central에 연결합니다. Intiface 설정에서 'Enable Remote Network Access'가 켜져 있는지 확인하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy maakt via WebSockets verbinding met Intiface Desktop of Intiface Central. Zorg dat 'Enable Remote Network Access' is ingeschakeld in de instellingen van Intiface."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyはWebSocketでIntiface DesktopまたはIntiface Centralに接続します。Intifaceの設定で「Enable Remote Network Access」がオンになっていることを確認してください。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy forbinder til Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Sørg for, at 'Enable Remote Network Access' er slået til i Intiface-indstillingerne."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stashy connects to Intiface Desktop or Intiface Central via WebSockets. Ensure 'Enable Remote Network Access' is turned on in Intiface settings."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy se connecte à Intiface Desktop ou Intiface Central via WebSockets. Vérifiez que « Enable Remote Network Access » est activé dans les réglages d'Intiface."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy si connette a Intiface Desktop o Intiface Central tramite WebSocket. Assicurati che 'Enable Remote Network Access' sia attivo nelle impostazioni di Intiface."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy ansluter till Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Se till att ”Enable Remote Network Access” är på i Intifaces inställningar."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy, Intiface Desktop veya Intiface Central'a WebSocket üzerinden bağlanır. Intiface ayarlarında 'Enable Remote Network Access' seçeneğinin açık olduğundan emin ol."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy 透過 WebSockets 連接 Intiface Desktop 或 Intiface Central。請確定已在 Intiface 設定中開啟「Enable Remote Network Access」。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy 通过 WebSockets 连接到 Intiface Desktop 或 Intiface Central。请确保在 Intiface 设置中打开了“Enable Remote Network Access”。"}}}},"hint_stashy_now_automatically_uploads_local":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy 现在会自动将本地 funscript 上传到 Handy Cloud。只有高级配置才需要公开 URL。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy laddar nu automatiskt upp lokala funscripts till Handy Cloud. Den publika URL:en behövs bara för avancerade upplägg."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy artık yerel funscript'leri otomatik olarak Handy Cloud'a yükler. Genel URL yalnızca gelişmiş kurulumlar için gerekir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy 現在會自動將本機 funscript 上傳至 Handy Cloud。只有進階設定才需要 Public URL。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyはローカルのfunscriptをHandy Cloudに自動でアップロードするようになりました。公開URLは高度な設定でのみ必要です。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy automatycznie wysyła lokalne funscripty do Handy Cloud. Publiczny URL jest potrzebny tylko w zaawansowanych konfiguracjach."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy agora envia automaticamente funscripts locais para a Handy Cloud. A URL pública só é necessária em configurações avançadas."}},"nb":{"s