onentów. Ich licencje obowiązują dodatkowo do warunków stashy."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy gebruikt de bovenstaande componenten. Hun licenties gelden naast de eigen voorwaarden van stashy."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy nutzt die oben genannten Komponenten. Ihre Lizenzen gelten zusätzlich zu stashys eigenen Bedingungen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy использует перечисленные выше компоненты. Их лицензии действуют в дополнение к условиям stashy."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy usa i componenti qui sopra. Le loro licenze si applicano in aggiunta ai termini di stashy."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy는 위의 구성 요소를 사용합니다. 해당 라이선스는 stashy 자체 약관에 추가로 적용됩니다."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruger komponenterne ovenfor. Deres licenser gælder ud over stashys egne vilkår."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyは上記のコンポーネントを使用しています。それらのライセンスはstashy自体の規約に加えて適用されます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy utilise les composants ci-dessus. Leurs licences s'appliquent en plus des conditions propres à stashy."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruker komponentene ovenfor. Lisensene deres gjelder i tillegg til stashys egne vilkår."}}}},"hint_subscribe_or_buy_lifetime_to":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Subscribe or buy Lifetime to unlock premium features."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abonner eller kjøp livstid for å låse opp premiumfunksjoner."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"프리미엄 기능을 잠금 해제하려면 구독하거나 평생 이용권을 구입하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Neem een abonnement of koop Levenslang om premiumfuncties te ontgrendelen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abonniere oder kaufe Lifetime, um Premium-Funktionen freiz